## Pi Source Code

Pi's full source code is installed at `/usr/lib/node_modules/pi-coding-agent/`.
You can read, search, and reference any file in this tree to understand how Pi works internally.

Key paths:
- Source: `/usr/lib/node_modules/pi-coding-agent/packages/coding-agent/src/`
- Docs: `/usr/lib/node_modules/pi-coding-agent/packages/coding-agent/docs/`
- Extensions: `/usr/lib/node_modules/pi-coding-agent/packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/`
- System extensions: `/usr/share/pi/extensions/`
